<title>USA: San Fran. port chief to head Phila. airport--paper.</title>
<headline>San Fran. port chief to head Phila. airport--paper.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philadelphia officials were set to announce that Dennis Bouey, director of the Port of San Francisco, was named Philadelphia's director of aviation, Philadelphia Inquirer reported Thursday.</p>
<p>Bouey, whose appointment would be effective Jan 1, would replace Mary Loney, who left this month to run Chicago's aiports.</p>
<p>Bouey, 48, was director of San Francisco International Airport before heading the city's port.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
